  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3102.23 Offset",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3102.23 \"Offset\" means \"offset\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,XX, namely \"the use of an ERC to compensate for emissions increases of a nonattainment pollutant from a new major stationary source or from a major modification to an existing stationary source subject to the requirements of the Act.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
